# Phase 3 construction artifacts — NEVER commit.
# See CLAUDE.md §A.10, §A.11, §A.12; Decisions 2.21, 2.23, 2.24; PR-REV-01.

# Coordination runtime state (created by installer, owned by the system).
.coord/

# Hook registrations and local overrides.
.claude/settings.local.json

# Construction-time logs and findings.
IMPLEMENTATION_LOG.md
FINDINGS.md

# Phase sign-offs (one per phase, gitignored per A.10).
phase-*-signoff.md

# Phase 0 verification artifact (gitignored per plan §5 Phase 0).
phase0-verification.md

# Phase POCs (e.g., phase-3-poc-mediator-spawn.md). POCs are
# investigative artifacts per CLAUDE.md §A.8; they accumulate findings
# but do NOT ship as production code. Authoritative learnings get
# folded into the corresponding signoff CLAUDE.md / plan-revisions
# updates.
phase-*-poc-*.md

# State-of-system briefings (reporting artifacts, not deliverables).
STATE_OF_SYSTEM.md

# Manual stress test outputs (per-run logs; Phase 7 / T7.08).
scripts/stress_semi_out/
scripts/stress_realistic_out/

# OS / editor cruft that has no place in VCS.
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
*.swo
